'''Bones''' is an [[Uncommon Weapons|uncommon]] knife that is currently obtainable by unboxing it from the [[2024 Halloween Box]] during the [[Halloween Event 2024]].  

== Appearance ==
This knife has a black overall color with a range of bones overlapping on the blade and one large bone on the handle, hence the name.

